          "reference": "Repeatedly halve a sorted array by comparing the target to the middle element.",
          "response": "```python\ndef binary_search(arr: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    low, high = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        if arr[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n    return -1\n```",
